Package: com.keyword.smsalert
Name: KeywordSMSAlert
Version: 1.1.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Alerts (vibration + ringer-channel sound) when an incoming SMS matches a keyword. SMS detection runs read-only in imagent; the alert engine and event-driven physical power-button observer run in a standalone mobile launchd service. Version 1.1.4 injects nothing into SpringBoard for compatibility with CallAssist 2.5.1. Includes a Settings pane (needs PreferenceLoader). Designed for Dopamine RootHide / roothide on iOS 15.4.1.
Maintainer: KeywordSMSAlert
Author: KeywordSMSAlert
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
